depth\n20\t(transcodes, crops, fat slices, clones, nested launchers) was never delivered in any mode. Timed kits are cumulative\n21\t(+1 field/day) with a 5-name sha256 synthesis; D22 Mastery grew to SIX sets.\n22\t**D22 \"Main Character Energy\" = JAR** (`jar.main_class` -> `Main-Class` verbatim; prebuilt race hit ~19 s).\n23\t**D23 \"Page Me Maybe\" = SQLite** (`sqlite.page_size_bytes` of one `database-001.sqlite`, 12 288 B = 3 x 4096; header\n24\tu16 BE @16, `1` = 65536; id `d23-sqlite-001-sqlite-...`, plain fmt `sqlite`). The D16-night prebuild `sqlite-header`\n25\tanswered it in the race probe (~29 s). Flavor: \"Application databases have been copied, truncated, embedded, and\n26\tmislabeled. Validate page geometry, connect databases to parent applications, and find the impossible claim.\" ->\n27\tunasked siblings: in-header size vs file length (truncation), magic at a non-zero offset (embedded), extension lies,\n28\tapplication_id / schema fingerprint -> parent app, header claims that cannot be true (version number, page size, WAL\n29\tflag without WAL). **D23 timed MUTATED the whole carry-over kit** (fat Mach-O, shuffled CD, Ogg/MP3 audio, non-x86\n30\tPE/ELF machines, re-rolled identity sizes) and taught that EVERY json list is answered SORTED (CD order rejected).\n31\t**D24 \"Event Horizon\" = EVTX** (`evtx.record_count` of one `events-001.evtx`, 69 632 B = 4 KiB header + one 64 KiB\n32\tchunk, 3 records; id `d24-evtx-001-evtx-record-count`, plain fmt `evtx`, integer). Count = walk `**\\0\\0` records in\n33\tevery chunk up to its free-space offset (header next_record_id-1 agreed in all 9 files, 3-119 records). Live worker\n34\t~21 s; TT 29 / Mastery 232 (EIGHT sets) CORRECT first try with no generalize -- D24 kit mutations (M4A/AAC + FLAC\n35\tunder `.wav`, thin LE-32 Mach-O, PE `0x0266`, ELF `0x0016`/`0x00b7`/`0x00f3`) were all parsed by the D23-generalized\n36\textractors. Flavor (unasked): \"Windows event logs from several hosts have been duplicated, tru