ists must be SORTED\", \"priority\": 1, \"action\": \"note\", \"detail\": \"D23 TT/Mastery re-rolled values that were constant D13-D22: PE Machine 0x01c0/0x01c2/0x01c4/0x01f0/0x0ebc/0x5064/0x8664, ELF e_machine 0x0003/0x0028/0x002b/0x0102, audio mp3/opus/vorbis/pcm_s16le, video dims arbitrary, Mach-O FAT 2-3 slices (0x7, 0xc, 0x12, 0x01000007, 0x0100000c, 0x01000012, 0x0200000c), shuffled zip CD, PDF 1.0-2.0, BOM true, identity sizes 72-378 B, sqlite page 512-65536. lib answered all values right; the two fail\n  {\"id\": \"ese-edb-header\", \"concept\": \"ESE / JET Blue database header (SRUM, WebCacheV01.dat, Windows.edb, ntds.dit) -- Windows DFIR block (D24 EVTX) AND application-database family\", \"priority\": 1, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"fmt ese (aliases edb, esedb, jet, srum). Header page 0 (LE): checksum u32 @0, signature `ef cd ab 89` @4, format_version u32 @8 (0x620), file_type u32 @12 (0 database, 1 streaming), database_time (8 B) @16, database_signature (28 B: random u32 + log time 8 B + computer name 16 B) @24, database_state u32 @52 (1 JustCreated, 2 DirtyShutdown, 3 CleanShutdown, 4 BeingCo\n  {\"id\": \"regf-dirty-translogs\", \"concept\": \"Registry hive integrity: dirty hive (sequence mismatch), transaction logs, checksum, bins vs size -- D24 'truncated/shortened' flavor applied to the next Windows DFIR artifact\", \"priority\": 1, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"New module lib/meta/prebuilt/regf_integrity.py, fmt regf (aliases registry, hive, ntuser, reg). Base block LE: `regf` @0, primary seq u32 @4, secondary seq u32 @8, last written FILETIME @12, major/minor @20/@24, file type @28 (0 primary, 1 log, 6 log new), root cell offset @36, hive bins data size u32 @40, clustering @44, file \n  {\"id\": \"amcache-shimcache\", \"concept\": \"Execution evidence from Amcache.hve and SYSTEM ShimCache (AppCompatCache)\", \"priority\": 1, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"Windows DFIR block, plausible D25-D28. Stdlib regf cell walk (n