size), file_page_count (len // page_size), in_header_page_count, is_truncated (true when len < expected or len % page_size != 0 with valid in-header size), trailing_bytes (le\n  {\"id\": \"sqlite-app-attribution\", \"concept\": \"Connect a database to its parent application (application_id, user_version, schema fingerprints)\", \"priority\": 2, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"D23 flavor 'connect databases to parent applications'. New module lib/meta/prebuilt/sqlite_apps.py, fmt sqlite: application_id_u32_hex (exists -- reuse), application_id_ascii (4 printable bytes BE, D23 `HTRT`), application_id_known_name (registered ids: 0x0f055112/0x0f055113 Fossil, 0x47504b47 `GPKG`, 0x47503130 `GP10`, 0x4d504258 MBTiles -- only ids listed in sqlite's magic.txt; else `none`), parent_ap\n  {\"id\": \"leveldb-indexeddb\", \"concept\": \"LevelDB / Chromium IndexedDB / Local Storage files (Electron & Chrome app data)\", \"priority\": 2, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"fmt leveldb (aliases ldb, indexeddb, local_storage). Table file (`*.ldb`/`*.sst`): 48-B footer at EOF = metaindex BlockHandle + index BlockHandle (varint64 pairs) + padding + magic `57 fb 80 8b 24 75 47 db` (LE 0xdb4775248b80fb57); blocks: entries (shared varint, non_shared varint, value_len varint, key delta, value) + restart array + 5-B trailer (compression type 0 none / 1 snappy + crc32c masked). Log file (`*.log`, `MANIF\n  {\"id\": \"sqlite-embedded-carve\", \"concept\": \"SQLite embedded in or mislabeled as another file (magic at a non-zero offset)\", \"priority\": 2, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"D23 flavor 'copied, truncated, embedded, and mislabeled'. fmt sqlite: make every sqlite.* field fall back to the FIRST `SQLite format 3\\\\0` occurrence when @0 is not the magic only for fields named embedded_* (keep the @0-or-`none` rule for plain fields -- a decoy must still answer `none`): embedded_offset (decimal), embedded_offset_hex, embedded_count (all header hits whose page size is va