 (`@0x7f0b0001` style or the inline string), app_label_locales (JSON {locale: value} from every ResTable_config)\n  {\"id\": \"apk-clone-rebuild-synthesis\", \"concept\": \"Cross-APK clone vs rebuild synthesis (package id / signer / version / label)\", \"priority\": 2, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"Extend lib.meta.synthesis (fmt synthesis) for ids `metadata-day-NN-synthesis-<key>` whose question lists several .apk (or .ipa) members in `Files: [...]` (parse like digest_order; get_bytes per set). Keys to support by id slug / question words: package_groups (JSON object package -> sorted member names, or list of lists sorted by first name), signer_groups (by signer cert sha256), clone_members ('clone' = same package\n  {\"id\": \"ios-ipa-identity\", \"concept\": \"iOS .ipa identity: Info.plist bundle fields, embedded.mobileprovision, main executable architecture\", \"priority\": 2, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"D21 'Mobile packages' (plural) + the lane's one-family-per-day walk -> iOS next is plausible. fmt ipa (aliases ios, ios_app): zip with `Payload/<Name>.app/Info.plist` (binary `bplist00` or XML; reuse prebuilt plist parser). Fields: bundle_identifier (CFBundleIdentifier verbatim), bundle_short_version (CFBundleShortVersionString), bundle_version (CFBundleVersion), bundle_display_name, bundle_name, bundle_ex\n  {\"id\": \"apk-native-abis-dex\", \"concept\": \"APK payload inventory: native-lib ABI set, multidex count, per-dex header, resources/assets\", \"priority\": 2, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"fmt apk: native_abis (JSON sorted set of `lib/<abi>/` dirs: arm64-v8a, armeabi-v7a, armeabi, x86, x86_64, riscv64), native_lib_names (CD order), native_lib_e_machines_u16_hex (per .so via elf e_machine), abi_mismatch (dir ABI vs e_machine disagree -> member names), dex_count (classes.dex, classes2.dex, ...), dex_names, dex_versions (from `dex\\\\n0NN\\\\0`), classes_dex_sha256 / classes_dex_checksum_u32_hex (route \n  {\"id\": \"aab-split-bu