GCC: (Ubuntu 11.4.0-1ubuntu1~22.04) 11.4.0`), abi_tag_os (NT_GNU_ABI_TAG desc u32[0]: 0 Linux, 1 GNU/Hurd, 2 Solaris, 3 FreeBSD) + abi_tag_kernel / min_kernel_version (`3.2.0`),\n  {\"id\": \"elf-ident-hex-siblings\", \"concept\": \"ELF ident/header fields in the GM `_uNN_hex` grammar + architecture name vocabularies\", \"priority\": 2, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"D19 field `elf.e_machine_u16_hex` = raw Elf_Ehdr member, `0x` + zero-padded to struct width, read in EI_DATA order. lib/meta/prebuilt/elf.py already has e_machine_u16_hex, e_type_u16_hex, e_flags_u32_hex, e_entry_hex, ei_class/ei_data/ei_osabi (as names `ELFDATA2LSB`/`ELFOSABI_NONE`), e_type (`2`). Add the hex/width grammar for every header member: ei_class_u8_hex (`0x02`), ei_data_u8_hex (`0x01`), ei_osabi_u8_hex\n  {\"id\": \"elf-arch-synthesis\", \"concept\": \"Cross-file architecture / deployment-group synthesis over ELF + PE + Mach-O members\", \"priority\": 2, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"D19 flavor 'Linux binaries from several systems have been pooled with Windows executables and renamed data ... rebuild deployment groups' (never asked yet; the D19 synthesis was still sha256-order). Add lib/meta/prebuilt/synthesis_arch.py over the `Files: [...]` list (same contract as lib.meta.synthesis.digest_order): classify each member by MAGIC (ELF/PE/Mach-O/fat/other) -> canonical (format, machine u16/u32 hex, bitn\n  {\"id\": \"media-image-as-video-stream\", \"concept\": \"Still images asked through `media.*` (ffprobe opens JP","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"persistedOutputPath":"/home/testpwn/.claude/projects/-home-testpwn-huntress-2026/c997e921-7591-43d7-ab62-2cec08c53d99/tool-results/bpq7spvkb.txt","persistedOutputSize":75792},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_018rkLEcUwrA5nTw6xRpCGhC","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
