{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01S12oqEY8VAJ3yzSeRxvt55","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# metadata-forensics — technique log (days 1-26; updated after every day)\n2\t\n3\tHow this lane has looked so far (observations, not guarantees):\n4\t- **Timed variants MUTATE** (organizer, D8: \"new, dynamic variations/mutations\"): solvers derive structure, degrade per field.\n5\t  **D23 mutated the WHOLE carry-over kit** (values that sat constant D13-D22 re-rolled: PE/ELF arch, audio codec, video\n6\t  dims, Mach-O became FAT, zip CD order shuffled) -- every carried extractor must parse the general case, not D-day's sample.\n7\t- Every day = ONE evidence zip (plain Deflate, no password). D1-7: one tiny member, one fact; D8-9: cumulative kit in\n8\t  every mode; D10-14: one field everywhere. **D15+ split the modes**: single = 1 field (the new member), TT = cumulative\n9\t  kit (D15 20 -> D26 31 fields, +1/day), Mastery = N kits x the TT set (N=5 to D21, then +1/day: 9 D25, 10 D26), incl. a\n10\t  cross-member \"synthesis\" question. Pre-arm EVERY earlier family AND the synthesis before the timed run.\n11\t- Member families: note/text -> jpg -> png -> pdf -> inner zip -> Go PE (D9-11) -> .NET dll (D12) -> MSI (D13) -> LNK\n12\t  (D14) -> OOXML `.docx` (D15) -> `.eml` (D16) -> WAV (D17) -> MP4 (D18) -> ELF (D19) -> Mach-O `macos-001.bin` (D20)\n13\t  -> APK `mobile-001.apk` (D21) -> JAR `application-001.jar` (D22) -> SQLite `database-001.sqlite` (D23) -> EVTX\n14\t  `events-001.evtx` (D24) -> registry hive `hive-001.hiv` (D25) -> Prefetch `trace-001.pf` (D26). D19-22 = runnable\n15\t  formats; D23 APPLICATION DATA (db header); D24-26 = the WINDOWS DFIR block (D24 first STRUCTURE WALK; D25 first\n16\t  POINTER FOLLOW: header offset -> cell; D26 first DECOMPRESS-THEN-PARSE: single was `MAM\\x04` Xpress-Huffman-wrapped).\n17\t  fmt word = an ABSTRACT namespace sometimes (`email` not `eml`; `media` for audio D17 AND video D18, ffprobe\n18\t  vocabulary), else the plain format (`pe` `msi` `lnk` `elf` `macho` `apk` `jar` `sqlite` `evtx` `prefetch`) -- read it from the question.\n19\t- Fields, one new per day (full list in \"Day by day\"; D25 `registry.hive_root_name`, D26 `prefetch.executable_name`).\n20\t  Question `Determine <fmt>.<field> for <member>`; id `dNN-<family>-NNN-<fmt>-<field>` (`.`/`_` -> `-`), `dNN` = the\n21\t  family's first day; `<family>` != `<fmt>` only for media (`d17-audio-001-media-`, `d18-video-...`). D25 fmt word\n22\t  `registry` (NOT the magic/lib name `regf`) -- the GM names the DOMAIN, the library may name the file format.\n23\t- Flavor text promises extra findings that are NEVER asked (collisions, crops, D19 deployment groups, D20 fleet, D21\n24\t  clones, D22 nested launchers, D23 \"truncated, embedded ... impossible claim\", D24 \"duplicated ... selectively\n25\t  shortened timeline\", D25 \"renamed and separated from host labels ... regroup the systems, and isolate the planted\n26\t  hive\"; D26 \"even after filenames changed ... connect execution traces to the correct hosts\"); the single sample\n27\t  delivers less. Graded = the\n28\t  STRUCTURAL truth; names/extensions/secondary metadata are the lie. Titles pun on the field (D19 \"Little Endian\" =\n29\t  EI_DATA; D20 \"Universal Appeal\" = fat; D21 \"Package Deal\"; D22 \"Main Character Energy\" = `Main-Class`; D23 \"Page Me\n30\t  Maybe\" = page size; D24 \"Event Horizon\" = how far the records reach = record count; D25 \"Hive Mind\" = the hive's\n31\t  root key name; D26 \"Before You Go\" = Prefetch, what Windows prepared BEFORE the exe ran). Flavor's \"true root\" = the field; \"renamed\" = the base-block name decoy. The flavor's depth shows up in\n32\t  the TIMED carry-over mutations (D23 fat Mach-O, D24 M4A/FLAC audio), not in new fields.\n33\t- Singles: D1-9 first-submit ~27-60 s; D10, D13, D15 lost ONE submit to a convention (padding, braces, list order);\n34\t  D16 lost TWO (`none`, stripped `<>`); D20 lost ONE (`[\"arm64\"]` -> hex won). Race probe from the prebuilt `lib.meta`\n35\t  registry: D18 ~5 s, D19 ~13 s, D22 ~19 s, D23 ~29 s (`lib/meta/prebuilt/sqlite.py`); registry MISS -> live worker D17\n36\t  ~24 s, D21 ~32 s; D24 live worker ~21 s (own struct chunk walk); D25 live worker ~17 s (race MISS: `regf.py` had\n37\t  `regf.root_key_name`, GM asked `registry.hive_root_name`); D26 prebuilt `prefetch.py` HIT (seed solver answered,\n38\t  worker cross-checked with dissect.util, submitted `--from-solver`) ~29 s.\n39\t  TT/Mastery: CORRECT every day; D15-17 + D19 after an offline generalize (synthesis dispatch missing); D23 after one\n40\t  wrong TT submit + generalize (list ORDER under mutation); D18, D20-22, D24 in-window first try\n41\t  (D24: TT 29 fields 8.4 s, Mastery 232 5.6 s; D25: TT 30 2.1 s, Mastery 270 = 9 sets 2.7 s; D26: TT 31 4.7 s, Mastery\n42\t  310 = 10 sets 8.0 s; zero generalize D24-26).\n43\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c997e921-7591-43d7-ab62-2cec08c53d99","uuid":"e8194c9f-8489-4db2-ac4c-9c2c0b76fd56","timestamp":"2026-10-26T13:09:12.123Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/testpwn/huntress-2026/reference/techniques/metadata-forensics.md","content":"# metadata-forensics — technique log (days 1-26; updated after every day)\n\nHow this lane has looked so far (observations, not guarantees):\n- **Timed variants MUTATE** (organizer, D8: \"new, dynamic variations/mutations\"): solvers derive structure, degrade per field.\n  **D23 mutated the WHOLE carry-over kit** (values that sat constant D13-D22 re-rolled: PE/ELF arch, audio codec, video\n  dims, Mach-O became FAT, zip CD order shuffled) -- every carried extractor must parse the general case, not D-day's sample.\n- Every day = ONE evidence zip (plain Deflate, no password). D1-7: one tiny member, one fact; D8-9: cumulative kit in\n  every mode; D10-14: one field everywhere. **D15+ split the modes**: single = 1 field (the new member), TT = cumulative\n  kit (D