hout `_hex`). Width from the STRUCT / `_uNN_`; value in the\n  file's own byte order. (Magic-prefix hex has NO `0x`; the binary lane wants `i386` -- different generator.)\n- GUIDs follow the source: .NET MVID lowercase no braces (D12); MSI ProductCode stored string uppercase WITH braces (D13).\n- Media codec names: ffprobe `codec_name` (WAV tag 1 -> `pcm_u8`/`pcm_s16le`/`pcm_s24le`/`pcm_s32le` by bits, 3\n  `pcm_f32le`, 6 `pcm_alaw`, 7 `pcm_mulaw`, 0x55 `mp3`; MP3 `mp3`; Ogg `opus`/`vorbis` -- all GM-accepted).\n- Rejected: `0x65bd0` (D10 unpadded); brace-less MSI GUID (D13); rels-order targets (D15); bracket-less Message-ID\n  (D16); `[\"arm64\"]` (D20); CD-order names (D23); Python repr `['a', 'b']` for any json (D23).\n- Inference: the field id IS the spec name (`sof_`, `eocd_total_entries` = the EOCD's own claim, `e_machine`,\n  `page_size`, libscca `executable_name`) -- read it literally to pick the structure; header CODES are raw `0x` hex.\n\n'''\nt=t[:a]+new+t[b:]\nopen(p,'w').write(t)\nEOF\nwc -l reference/techniques/metadata-forensics.md"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1554,"cache_read_input_tokens":133666,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1554},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c997e921-7591-43d7-ab62-2cec08c53d99","uuid":"1515480e-d19b-4d87-81be-c0c7edd7e748","timestamp":"2026-10-26T13:09:52.247Z","request_id":"req_011CgQuKaY6owwHY11gFsrha","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01QDNEJVpg7rCpvDQ3Ykw3Co":{"command":"cd /home/testpwn/huntress-2026; python3 - <<'EOF'\np='reference/techniques/metadata-forensics.md'\nt=open(p).read()\na=t.index(\"## GM answer conventions learned\"); b=t.index(\"## Delivery layouts seen\")\nnew='''## GM