on time\n(= host), the full exe path from the filename strings.\nProgression: D19-D22 runnable formats -> D23 APPLICATION DATA -> D24-D26 WINDOWS DFIR (EVTX walk, hive pointer-follow,\nprefetch decompress-then-parse), fmt = the DOMAIN word, one artifact per day, every family lasting one day. D27-D29\nmost plausibly more of the DFIR block: $MFT / USN / jump lists / recycle bin `$I` / Amcache / ShimCache / SRUM-ESE /\nETL / minidump / thumbcache / Timeline-BITS-WMI / task XML are all PREBUILT; unbuilt DFIR = filesystem boot sectors\n(NTFS VBR / MBR / GPT), $LogFile + `$I30` INDX, ESE catalog (SRUM tables), WER / Defender / PSReadLine text artifacts.\nD29-D31 may leave Windows (Linux journald/utmp, macOS `.DS_Store`/FSEvents, memory images, PCAP / X.509 prebuilt).\nCarried families keep mutating in the timed kits; expect the prefetch wrapper/version to flip (D26 already flipped\ncompressed -> plain between modes): keep extractors general (all SCCA versions, MAM with/without CRC).\n\n'''\nt=t[:a]+new+t[b:]\nrep(\"| 35 | Prefetch: exe name, run count, last-run times (1 or 8), volume serial/path, prefetch hash | prebuilt prefetch |\",\n    \"| 35 | Prefetch: exe name, run count, last-run times (1 or 8), volume serial/path, prefetch hash | seen D26 `prefetch.executable_name` (SCCA name @16 verbatim uppercase `.EXE`; single MAM-compressed, timed plain v30); siblings prebuilt prefetch (v31 / hash recompute / full path = gaps) |\")\nrep(\"| struct after decompress; `pyscca`/`windowsprefetch` (M); LZXpress-Huffman needs `dissect.util` (M) |\",\n    \"| struct after decompress; `lib/meta/prebuilt/prefetch.py` (pure-Python Xpress-Huffman); `dissect.util.compression.lzxpress_huffman` (I, worker-only); `pyscca`/`windowsprefetch` (M) |\")\nrep('.. .. .. .. 53 43 43 41 (SCCA@4)  Prefetch v17/23/26/30; \"MAM\\\\x04\"@0 = Win10 compressed (LZXpress Huffman)',\n    '.. .. .. .. 53 43 43 41 (SCCA@4) Prefetch (D26 `prefetch.executable_name` = UTF-16LE @16 to NUL, verbatim); ver u32@0 17/23/26/30/31; \"MAM\\\\x04\"@0 = Xpress-Huffman: size u32@4, stream@8 (@12 if type&0x80) -> DECOMPRESS FIRST')\nopen(p,'w').write(t)\nEOF\ngrep -c \"\" reference/coverage/metadata-forensics.md; awk '/^## Recognition cues/{f=1;next} /^## /{f=0} f' reference/coverage/metadata-forensics.md | wc -l"}}}
